186:> - **Next**: E2 — in the ~7 strips, reproject the non-selected camera's near content into the selected camera's view via the rig's KNOWN homography-at-infinity + epipole + LiDAR z (closed-form, not estimated), THEN blend; far field stays == L1. Judge by relative_warp (near-seam doubling down, far field 0) + vision. Optionally do E1.5 low-freq-only first as the clean photometric baseline.
